cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it using the metadata below. Please also cite the original GGPP paper, listed under references."
title: "GGPP-RankAware: rank-aware prefix optimization for prompt-perturbation attacks on RAG retrieval"
abstract: >-
  A drop-in replacement for the prefix optimizer in the GGPP (KDD'24) release that
  optimises the rank of the correct passage directly instead of a cosine proxy.
  On IMDB + SFR-Embedding-Mistral over 100 per-query paired queries, strict success
  rises from 15% to 72% with 57 fail-to-success flips and no regressions.
type: software
license: MIT
